    "detailed_description": "<h1>Cave Quest 3 is in development</h1><p><br>Please wishlist it if you like to support us!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1218560/extras/1082f01f5d2e86e4794630121b13ba26.avif?t=1667049356\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Help the young master of an ancient Tibetan game hunt for amazing treasures in \u201cBato: Treasures of Tibet\u201d. Let stones of the same color collide to clear the entire game board and continue your awesome journey! Meet curious characters as you take part in an thrilling adventure. Master the incredible power ups to make it to the end of your travels and win amazing treasures! This game becomes more challenging along the way, so make sure your skills improve fast. Are you ready for this adventure in the wonderful Tibet? Play Bato now!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tComplete challenging levels by knocking stones of the same colour together.<br></li><li>\tPlay quickly, strategically, and accurately to clear the board.<br></li><li>\tReceive help from your great mentor and the famous multi-handed god figurine.<br></li><li>\tEarn points, blessings, and mana for upgrades that can help you during levels.</li></ul>",
